<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF to seek 30,000T of cottonseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF to seek 30,000T of cottonseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's state-backed National Livestock Cooperative Federation said it has invited tenders for 30,000 tonnes of cottonseed meal by 11.00 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Friday.  </p>
<p>An NLCF official said arrival was set for three port cites of Inchon, Kunsan and Ulsan. He did not give further details.</p>
<p>Details of the tender obtained from trading sources are as follows:</p>
<p>POSITION  TONNE     SHIPMENT	     ARRIVAL PORT</p>
<p>   1	7,000     Nov 21-Dec 10	Inchon</p>
<p>   2	8,000     Nov 21-Dec 10	Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>   3	7,000     Dec 21-Jan 10	Inchon</p>
<p>   4	8,000     Dec 21-Jan 10	Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (828) 727 5651</p>
</text>
